<i><b>Upgrade Notes</b></i>

* Requires NSP V1.43.7 or newer.

<b>V2.31.4 Release</b>

<i><b>Changes</b></i>

* Internal changes to improve calibration of external widebands

<b>V2.31.0 Release</b>

<i><b>Important Notes</b></i>

<i><b>Features</b></i>

* Added Dual Fuel Transfer function.

* Added an extra setting to <b>Camera Input</b> called <b>Stretch Type</b> to allow the camera to stretch to the entire screen size.

* Support <b>ECUMaster</b> ecu protocol.

* Added <b>Fuel Level<b> to <b>General Motors E38</b> third party CAN protocol.

<i><b>Changes</b></i>

* Support for generic GPS Module and Lap Timing Module.

* Removed minimum font size restriction of 20 pixels for dial gauges

* A new Dash component <b>Text Component</b> added

* Gear detection now prioritises Reverse switch, then Neutral switch, then detected gear.

* When gear detection method is <i>RPM Drop</i> or <i>Gear Ratio</i> and the clutch is pressed, the gear will always be unknown.

* Changed unknown gear symbol form "U" to "-".

<b>Fixes</b>

* Fixes incorrect states showing when AVIs are used with a Button Mode of Push On Push Off

* Formatted Time now displays seconds with a leading 0 for single digit seconds
    * stops the width changing when rolling over to double digits.

* Fixed the colour options affecting wrong parts of dial gauge components in Dash
    * All circular gauges
        * The major and minor ticks follow the <b>Circular Tick</b> colour.
    * Circular Classic
        * The enclosing circle follows <b>Circular Tick</b> colour instead of <b>Circular Markings</b> colour
        * The warning area of tickmark is highlighted by <b>Warning<b> colour
    * Retro 1
        * The warning area of tickmark follows <b>Warning<b> colour  instead of <b>Circular Markings Warning</b> colour
        * The warning area of marking follows <b>Circular Markings Warning</b> colour
    * Retro 2
        * The warning area of marking follows <b>Circular Markings Warning</b> colour

* While Resizing Dash components FontSize will be a minimum of 1 pixel

* Fixes screen thumbnails not being generated dynamically

* Fixes an issue with incorrect log time duration and operation over long durations

* Replaced default font

